siness_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"XeLAOIv2Ky1wyzIjoTa3Mg","review_id":"GmYCDVMXYCugnFO_eMtE5Q","date":"2019-10-26T02:08:51","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9523265957832336,"text_excerpt":"Coffee Science is a super great local spot! It's open until 11pm every day which is nice when you need some caffeine later in the day but want something smaller than Starbucks with cool brews. They've got so many different types of coffee, you can choose which beans you want and the style- pour over, french press, aeropress, you name it, they've got it! It's nice to be able to try a coffee bean with the way you would make it at home before you buy a bag of it, which is one of my favorite parts of Coffee Science. Plus, all the employees are super personable and knowledgeable about coffee and all their products and are more than happy to answer your questions, but not in a snobby way at all..."},{"business_id":"XeLAOIv2Ky1wyzIjoTa3Mg","review_id":"u4xVhcdHy9xtZ9_wkygNbA","date":"2018-06-22T16:16:30","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9349492788314819,"text_excerpt":"Super cute spot with really great coffee! I live in ATL but was recently visiting NO and happened upon Coffee Science. I am a sucker for a new coffee shop. Coffee Science opened in Jan 2018. The location is clean and modern and plays to the concept of \"coffee science\" by displaying test tubes, beakers,etc. Very creative. I believe my barista was wearing a lab coat, too. I stopped in twice in one weekend and each time the coffee was superb. I could taste an underlying fruitiness in one of the cups. It was amazing and perfectly brewed. I didn't have a whole lot of time to converse with the men working there because I was in a rush, but I wish I would have. I want to know more about where th..."},{"business_id":"XeLAOIv2Ky1wyzIjoTa3Mg","review_id":"3locVJij8JURxzP8fR5j_g","date":"2021-10-15T14:49:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9349029660224915,"text_excerpt":"This place was great. I had an iced matcha latte and a brioche egg pastry. Both were delicious. I love the large outside area in the back. They had plenty of seating and shade. I also saw them setting up for a little market which is wonderful, supporting other small businesses. They seemed to have a pretty cool variety of non coffee drinks I want to explore."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"XeLAOIv2Ky1wyzIjoTa3Mg","photo_id":"iQXz2NYuejtwRSvkv3bLVw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/iQXz2NYuejtwRSvkv3bLVw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8800487518310547},{"business_id":"XeLAOIv2Ky1wyzIjoTa3Mg","photo_id":"mYKBjqEaRNjPGx3aNfvuwQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/mYKBjqEaRNjPGx3aNfvuwQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8646756410598755},{"business_id":"XeLAOIv2Ky1wyzIjoTa3Mg","photo_id":"GxmBRzd7zJSgKZ2frbtujQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/GxmBRzd7zJSgKZ2frbtujQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8617408275604248},{"business_id":"XeLAOIv2Ky1wyzIjoTa3Mg","photo_id":"_seqNd3yu7X_KrL_ClRSbQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/_seqNd3yu7X_KrL_ClRSbQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8277355432510376},{"business_id":"XeLAOIv2Ky1wyzIjoTa3Mg","photo_id":"gCdfHzyLPrYraOqORCYY9A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/gCdfHzyLPrYraOqORCYY9A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7624438405036926}]},"notebook_case":null}
